    <description>Grants Executives and Trustees full read visibility across all events, registrations, and financial data for governance and reporting purposes. No create, edit, or delete access is granted on any object. View All is enabled on Event__c and Event_Registration__c to ensure complete organisational visibility regardless of record ownership. This permission set is the sole source of all object and field access for this persona — the base profile grants no object permissions.</description>
